   "text": "For every wound there is a blessing; for every death, a reckoning.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Paladin of Atonement",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/16s/paladin-of-atonement"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Cut the beasts out from under them and their strength is nothing.\" —Vona of Iedo, Butcher of Magan",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Slaughter the Strong",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/22s/slaughter-the-strong"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Be still.\" —Azor",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Sphinx's Decree",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/24s/sphinxs-decree"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Kinjalli sculpted humans from clay, but the dinosaurs were carved from unyielding stone.\" —Itzama the Crested",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Temple Altisaur",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/28s/temple-altisaur"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"I would advise you not to struggle.\" —Huatli",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Trapjaw Tyrant",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/29s/trapjaw-tyrant"
  },
  {
