   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Mastermind's Acquisition",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/77p/masterminds-acquisition"
  },
  {
   "text": "As the struggle raged for control of the Immortal Sun, the world grew dark under a blood-red sky.",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Blood Sun",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/92p/blood-sun"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Why squabble for trinkets when we could be living large off all this gold?\" —Admiral Beckett Brass",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Brass's Bounty",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/94p/brasss-bounty"
  },
  {
