   "card": "Etali, Primal Storm",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/100s/etali-primal-storm"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Control them? No. I gird them in armor and let them loose.\" —Yacha, Otepec huntmaster",
   "scene": 0,
   "card": "Silverclad Ferocidons",
   "url": "https://scryfall.com/card/prix/115p/silverclad-ferocidons"
  },
  {
